OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 5 Aug to Fri 14 AugFA
OL,6,Fgenerally rather changeable period
OL,7,Flooks likely, with many places likely
OL,8,Fto see some much needed rain or
OL,9,Fshowers at times but also some more
OL,10,Fsunshine. Initially, some rain or
OL,11,Fshowers will affect many parts, this
OL,12,Fheavy and possibly thundery in places.
OL,13,FAfter a drier, brighter few days,
OL,14,Ffurther changeable or unsettled
OL,15,Fconditions may develop as we head
OL,16,Ftowards mid-August. This may be due to
OL,17,Ffrontal systems moving in from the
OL,18,FAtlantic or thundery plumes moving
OL,19,Fnorth from the continent or a
OL,20,Fcombination of both. Temperatures will
OL,21,Flikely be a little above average
OL,22,Foverall, and there is the potential
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Ffor some very warm or hot and humid
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Fspells, especially in the south,
OL,25,Falthough perhaps not the heat we have
OL,26,Fseen in recent weeks.
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
PN,16303
SC,0003
CT,20,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1785507491
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G3/3
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Fri 14 Aug to Fri 28 Aug
OL,6,FDry and settled conditions look likely
OL,7,Fto dominate much of this period with
OL,8,Fhigh pressure patterns tending to
OL,9,Faffect the UK. This may be interrupted
OL,10,Fat times by Atlantic frontal systems,
OL,11,Fespecially in the north, or
OL,12,Fthunderstorms in the south. However,
OL,13,Foverall, rainfall amounts will likely
OL,14,Fbe below normal. Temperatures will
OL,15,Fprobably be above normal and some
OL,16,Fspells of hot weather and heatwaves
OL,17,Fare possible, especially in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
